  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Before they meet, the two vehicles have traveled a combined distance of \\(300-50=250\\) km. Let the time be \\(t\\) hours. Then \\((60+40)t=250\\). Solving gives \\(t=2.5\\).",
